{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel><data id=\"sid\"/></datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\"><onentry><send event=\"t\" id=\"s1\" idlocation=\"sid\" delay=\"1s\"/><cancel sendid=\"s1\" sendidexpr=\"sid\"/></onentry><transition event=\"t\" target=\"f\"/></state><final id=\"f\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml014-send-id-and-idlocation.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":2,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml014-send-id-and-idlocation.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":17,"byteOffset":187,"endColumn":66,"endLine":3,"startColumn":49,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"keep `id` and remove `idlocation`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml014-send-id-and-idlocation.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":49,"endLine":3,"startColumn":42,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"send ID cannot use both `id` and `idlocation`\n\n**Note:** each `<send>` property (event, target, type, delay, and the send ID as `id` or `idlocation`) has one literal and one computed form; supplying both is ambiguous\n\n**Help:** keep exactly one of `id` or `idlocation`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>","text":"send ID cannot use both `id` and `idlocation`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":187,"start":180},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"conflicting attribute"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml014-send-id-and-idlocation.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":66,"endLine":3,"startColumn":50,"startLine":3}}